O0021 (BACKWARD GOTO LOOP, FORWARD SKIPS, BREAK OUT OF A LOOP)
G21 G90 G17
#1 = 0
N10 #1 = #1 + 1
IF [#1 EQ 3.] GOTO 20
G0 X#1 Y0
N20 IF [#1 LT 5.] GOTO 10
GOTO 30
G0 X50. Y50.
N30 #2 = 0
WHILE [#2 LT 100.] DO1
#2 = #2 + 7.
IF [#2 GT 30.] GOTO 40
G0 X0 Y#2
END1
N40 G0 X99. Y#2
#3 = 0
DO2
#3 = #3 + 1.
IF [#3 GE 2.] GOTO 50
END2
N50 G0 X#3 Y-1.
M30
